### Get Me with User A token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userAToken}}

### Get Me with User B token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userBToken}}

### Protected hello with User A token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/protected/hello
Authorization: Bearer {{userAToken}}

### Promote User B with regular user token
# Должен вернуть 403 Forbidden
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/promote/{{userBId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAToken}}

### Promote User B with admin token
# Должен вернуть 200 OK и role=admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/promote/{{userBId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Rate limiter demo
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
